    <div class="home-wayfinding">
      <a href="/teaching/2026-2027"><span>For students</span><strong>Courses · 2026–2027</strong><span>Tutorials and activities ↗</span></a>
      <a href="/projects"><span>Public work</span><strong>Projects &amp; code</strong><span>Explore the project collection ↗</span></a>
      <a href="/quantum-community/events"><span>Community</span><strong>Events &amp; meetings</strong><span>Find the next gathering ↗</span></a>
